<item>
<title>Pakistan and Afghanistan: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/afghanistan-pakistan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-afghanistan-pakistan-2026-11-11T06:51:27.880Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 06:51:27 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Lawyers are striking against the suspension of provincial health commission powers while armed clashes continue, including three deaths in a Noshki firing and nine BLA terrorists killed in a precision strike in Balochistan. A shooting over a TikTok dispute left two people dead, and a drone dropped pistols, cartridges and heroin near the Punjab border. Iran is seeking to contain the war between Pakistan and the Taliban, and the repatriation of illegal Afghan nationals is slowing in Khyber. The conflict still accounts for 1,794 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxOZE1GR2g4SF91OENXUE5QbTRwakRCQUhtejRIQ1VucEI0aHlta193Y0pieUJTR0FoU2dsMEEtWG9Ma1VEVnREcEFtaGtZMlhUNW1uRHhpX1o2eEhLdHhncVhMRU1JUHFaY2V5WWd3YlJSNFNncVdCN3FGdlpkRmRiWFRVaTJ1dkNUckEwTDI5SFZPbElXWjA2eXBBZUM?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMicEFVX3lxTFBBWUR3RDdHdVE4QUVubWw4N01sRVJnVkRobnpya3dxRF9KU0FaQ0s5Rm15VjVCQm9Zekc3MzlyMjA4V2JLcFhkVnUwYUt5TEY1b09IY3FNRDNlUXgtVzBtUExWSHlDY1hBRnZNR193OFU?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Radio Free Europe/Radio Liberty&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxPWXhLLS1BaVlDSFRvNWlDeURnQVF6RW85YkYycUs0TkpKd29LeGpfYkRwS3NlX3JRZDFyRGE2VkRBdnlQdHFFVXZxdW9aYTh6Y1gxQ0x0NF9vUGk4SWJqb29lTndFOF9OYlZCNFZ3Z3Utd3dHOFVxWHpLYkh4VUpaUmFuVnp0ZkpmLU9DSmpoUnVsVUMtMEt1SkFqQjZfVTNPajEwaDJlUk9HZ3pZRUpqckVR?oc=5&quot;&gt;UA.NEWS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;India Today&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of India&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxPaVBQYmZmZjI5eU01X2VCTm0ydktickdZYVA4QURQc1FNajRsM3dOOUdPTWJIY